    "title": "Aninhamento de Condicionais",
    "descriptionContent": "Aprenda a aninhar outros blocos de código, como declarações condicionais, dentro de funções.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17462,
        "title": "Aninhamento de Condicionais",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148163,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hora de criar funções que tomam decisões. Como primeiro passo, vamos ver como aninhar declarações condicionais dentro de funções.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148164,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sabemos que funções são blocos de código. Isso significa que instruções aninhadas são cercadas por chaves e têm espaço extra no lado esquerdo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showHUDMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showHUDMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level Start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{</code> seguido de <code>console.log(message);</code> e finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148165,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos adicionar outros blocos de código dentro de uma função. Quando fazemos isso, o par extra de chaves nos permite saber quais instruções pertencem a onde.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss room unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{</code> seguido de <code>{</code> e depois <code>}</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148166,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O espaço à esquerda é chamado de <strong>indentação</strong>. Quando adicionamos um bloco de código dentro de outro, o bloco de código inteiro é indentado por um espaço.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"playSpawnSound\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"eventName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (eventName === \" /><text value=\"&quot;spawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn sound!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playSpawnSound(\" /><text value=\"&quot;spawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>if (eventName === \"spawn\") {</code> seguido de <code>console.log(\"Spawn sound!\");</code> e finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148167,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Envolver declarações <code>if</code> dentro de funções nos ajuda a organizar e reutilizar nosso código. Agora, podemos usar a mesma declaração <code>if</code> com uma chamada de função.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss room unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>canEnterBossRoom</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>6</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148168,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Instruções fora de blocos de código aninhados ainda são executadas, mesmo que o código dentro da instrução condicional seja ignorado.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss room unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Gate check complete&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148169,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando adicionamos uma declaração <code>if</code> dentro de uma função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Estamos adicionando um bloco de código dentro de outro bloco de código</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A função irá pular o bloco <code>if</code> quando chamada</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Estamos adicionando um bloco de código dentro de outro bloco de código.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148170,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quantas instruções fora da declaração <code>if</code> essa função possui?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss room unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Gate check done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"canEnterBossRoom(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Uma instrução de exibição</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nenhuma, todas as instruções fazem parte da declaração <code>if</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Uma instrução de exibição.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148171,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como é chamado o espaço à esquerda de uma instrução aninhada?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indentação</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um bloco de código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher Indentação.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148172,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que é útil encapsular condicionais dentro de funções?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Isso nos ajuda a organizar e reutilizar nosso código</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não é, é o mesmo que reescrever uma declaração <code>if</code> toda vez que precisamos dela</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Isso nos ajuda a organizar e reutilizar nosso código.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual declaração de exibição é executada ao chamar <code>checkCollision(false)</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkCollision\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"colliding\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Collision system running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (colliding === \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No collision&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkCollision(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ambas as instruções de exibição são executadas</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Apenas a segunda instrução de exibição é executada</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ambas as instruções de exibição são executadas.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aninhe a declaração <code>if</code> dentro da função.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasEnoughXP\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"xp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (xp &gt;= \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hasEnoughXP(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{</code> seguido de <code>{</code> e depois <code>}</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Exiba apenas <code>\"Checking XP\"</code> no console colocando-o fora da declaração <code>if</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isGameOver\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Checking health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isGameOver(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"Checking health\"</code> seguido de <code>\"Game Over\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Exiba ambas as mensagens no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"135\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isPlayerAlive\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"alive\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (alive === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is alive&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isPlayerAlive(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aumente <code>health</code> em 50 se for menor que 100. Exiba <code>health</code> no final da função.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayHealth\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  health = health + \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(health);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayHealth(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>health = health + 50;</code> seguido de <code>console.log(health);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Reduza o <code>score</code> em 500 apenas se for maior que 2100.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"applyPenalty\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt; \" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  score = score - \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScore = applyPenalty(\" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(finalScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}